kind: llman.sdd.delta
ops[3]{op,req_id,title,statement,from,to,name}:
  add_requirement,analysis-relations-must-use-vector-knn,"Analysis relation detection MUST use per-entry vector KNN index query",分析 relations 检测 MUST 对每个 chunk 调用向量索引的 KNN 查询（top_k=20、min_score=0.7、排除同 source），MUST NOT 使用内存暴力 pairwise cosine 替代索引查询；v2 已具备 searchVectors KNN（db/vectors.ts），analysis 路由 MUST 复用该能力以保证与 v1 detect_relations 的边集一致,null,null,null
  add_requirement,analysis-relations-score-must-align-v1-semantics,"Analysis relation score MUST align with v1 distance-derived semantics",分析 relation 的 score 字段 MUST 与 v1 语义对齐（v1 chroma cosine space 下 score = 1 - distance），不得直接使用 raw cosine 数值，以使 min_score 阈值（0.7）与前端按百分比渲染（score*100）的呈现与 v1 一致,null,null,null
  add_requirement,analysis-topics-must-carry-real-chunk-ids,"Analysis topics MUST carry non-empty chunk_ids backed by real clustering",分析返回的 topics 项 MUST 携带来自真实聚类计算的非空 chunk_ids，MUST NOT 注入 LLM 生成的 chunk_ids:[] 占位 topic；LLM 叙事/总结 SHALL 单独放在 narrative 字段下而非混入 topics,null,null,null
op_scenarios[4]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  analysis-relations-must-use-vector-knn,knn-edges,"已索引 chunk 向量的 notebook","系统运行 detect_relations","每个 chunk SHALL 通过向量索引 KNN 查询（而非内存暴力 cosine）产出 similar 关系，边集与 v1 对齐"
  analysis-relations-score-must-align-v1-semantics,score-threshold,"同一组 embedding 向量","v1 与 v2 各自计算 relation.score","v2 的 score 数值 SHALL 匹配 v1 的 1-distance 语义，使 min_score=0.7 阈值切出可比的边集"
  analysis-topics-must-carry-real-chunk-ids,topics-have-chunks,"notebook 含可聚类的 chunk","系统返回 analysis 结果","每个 topic 的 chunk_ids SHALL 非空且来自真实聚类；LLM 叙事 SHALL 单独放在 narrative 字段"
  analysis-topics-must-carry-real-chunk-ids,relation-type-references,"消费方读取 RelationType","系统声明关系类型枚举","relationType SHALL 包含 similar/references/contradicts 以与共享 schema (packages/shared) 一致"
